## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Haversine thresholds** — The deduplication radius is set to **500m** and the scheduled lifecycle check runs every **15 min**. Are these acceptable for Pakistan's urban density? (e.g., Karachi's Saddar area could have two distinct incidents 300m apart.)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Simulation timers in Cloud Functions** — `setTimeout` does not survive Cloud Function cold starts or instance recycling. The safer approach for Issue #5 is to write a `scheduled_transitions` sub-collection and have the `crisisLifecycleManager` process it on each run. **Do you want the simpler (setTimeout) approach for the hackathon demo, or the production-safe sub-collection approach?**

> [!WARNING]
> **`PushTokens` collection** — For Issue #9, the notification agent needs to know where device tokens are stored. Is there an existing `PushTokens` Firestore collection from the AI Lawyers Diary project we can mirror, or should we define a new schema?

